12 Keys and mouse
*****************

Mouse
----------------------------------------------------------------------
click                     select it
double-click              open it (a folder goes in)
Ctrl+click                add it to the selection, or take it out
Shift+click               select everything from the last one to
                          here
right-click               what can be done with it, or with the
                          folder
drag a row out            give the file to another program
drop files in             copy them here
Keys
----------------------------------------------------------------------
RET                       open
M-Left, M-Right           back, forward
M-Up or ^                 the folder above
C-l                       go to a folder, typed
M-w, C-w, C-y             copy, cut, paste
Delete                    to the Trash
F2                        rename
+                         new folder
C-/                       undo the last change
s                         next sort
.                         hidden files
/                         only names with...
M-s f                     find below
F5                        refresh
F3                        two panes, or one
F11                       the preview, or none
C-c C-c, F6               copy, move to the other pane
F9                        places
C-x 5 2                   another Esploro window
C-x C-c                   close Esploro (Emacs goes on)
?, F1                     this manual
m, u, U                   mark, unmark, unmark all (dired's)


